# Scenarios UnderworldGodot does not pass yet, one per line:
#
#   <game>/<name>  ~<part of the expected FAIL reason>  # the bug, with the port's file:line and the original's
#
# A listed scenario still runs and prints its failure but does not fail the run, as long as it
# fails for the listed reason: its FAIL reason must contain the ~ text, and must not start with
# "precondition:" or name an exception (then the scenario no longer reaches the bug it tests, and
# the run fails). One that starts passing fails the run until its line is removed, in the piece that
# fixes it. Original sources: https://github.com/abedegno/underworld-exhumed (uw1/src, uw2/src).
uw1/experience-loss     ~experience after the loss expected  # the loss branch computes Exp - newEXP with newEXP already negative (src/player/playerdat.cs:729), so the death penalty adds experience: 1800 less 225 gives 2025; uw1/src/game/SKILLCHK.C:76-82
uw2/experience-loss     ~experience after the loss expected  # the same line (src/player/playerdat.cs:729): 1800 less 200 gives 2000; uw2/src/game/SKILLCHK.C:71-77
uw1/sleep-passes-time   ~clock advance over the night expected  # AdvanceTime only prints (src/player/playerdatclock.cs:86), so a night's sleep leaves the clock where it was; uw1/src/game/SKILLS.C:545-546, 580-583 add 7 to 10 hours
uw2/sleep-passes-time   ~clock advance over the night expected  # AdvanceTime only prints (src/player/playerdatclock.cs:86); uw2/src/game/SKILLS.C:463-466, 507-510 pass 7 to 10 hours through pass_time (uw2/src/event/WORLDEV.C:163-166)
uw1/new-game-record     ~food_heal expected  # InitEmptyPlayer sets fatigue 0x30 and food_heal 0 (src/player/playerdatainit.cs:152, 166) where init_char sets 0x40 and 0x40 (uw1/src/game/CHARGEN.C:120-121)
uw2/new-game-record     ~food_heal expected  # InitEmptyPlayer sets food_heal 0 (src/player/playerdatainit.cs:166) where init_char sets 0x30 (uw2/src/game/CHARGEN.C:106), and SetMoonstone(1, 3) then SetMoonstone(1, 45) (src/player/playerdatainit.cs:212-213) leave moonstone 0 at 0 where init_char puts it on level 3 (uw2/src/game/CHARGEN.C:87-88)
